  "details": "I am creating a Custom Editor for a script I am working on. When you add the Interact method to your script, the Proximity slider is created. I would like to change this slider value through my script.\n\nThere is no documentation on how to do this, but I have tried getting the VRCInteractable component and setting the proximity property through that, but an error tells me that this not exposed to Udon.\n\nIf there is a way to do this, can you please inform me how to do it. If not, can this feature be added pls?",
